From 581499260c13076094916fd57d962098ac800eaf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Meron Cohen <mecohen@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 17 Jun 2025 13:43:40 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-229758] gaudi2: bump svn to 11

